          "briefTitle": "D-1553 Tablet Versus Docetaxel Injection for KRAS G12C Mutation-positive Locally Advanced or Metastatic Non-small Cell Lung Cancer After Prior Standard Therapy Failure",
          "officialTitle": "A Randomized, Controlled, Double-blind, Double-simulated, Multicenter Phase III Clinical Study Evaluating D-1553 Tablet Versus Docetaxel Injection for KRAS G12C Mutation-positive Locally Advanced or Metastatic Non-small Cell Lung Cancer After Prior Standard Therapy Failure."
        },
