              "description": "Fitness index is computed based on age and sex specific norm-reference values of 5 standardized tests assessing balance, shoulder neck mobility, trunk flexibility, ability to stabilize trunk and lower extremity endurance strength.",
              "timeFrame": "Baselilne, 3 months"
            }
          ],
