          "briefTitle": "Mindful Movement for Physical Activity and Wellbeing in Older Adults",
          "officialTitle": "Mindful Movement for Physical Activity and Wellbeing in Older Adults: A Community Based Randomized Hybrid Effectiveness-Implementation Study"
        },
