          "briefTitle": "Long Term Effects of Inspiratory Muscle Training in Cerebral Palsy",
          "officialTitle": "Inspiratory Muscle Training in Adults With Cerebral Palsy: Long Term Effects. A Double-blind Randomised Controlled Trial"
        },
        "statusModule": {
