              "description": "The endothelial function will be evaluated using echocardiography. After a resting baseline, Brachial artery diameter will be recorded, the cuff used in blood pressure measurement will be inflated 25-50 mmHg above the systolic blood pressure value and maintain that pressure for 5 min. The brachial artery diameter will be measured again after the cuff is deflated.",
