              "measure": "Life Quality",
              "description": "This variable is measured with the European quality of life- 5 dimensions- 5 levels (EQ-5D-5L). This scale ranges from 5 to 25. A higher score means less life quality (more health-related problems).",
              "timeFrame": "From Enrollment to End-of-treatment (6-weeks), one-, three-, six-, -month follow-up."
