              "timeFrame": "Safety Run-In, Expansion: Predose (Hr 0), 0.5 Hr postdose (infusion duration: 1 Hr) on D1 of Cy1, 3; predose (Hr 0) on D1 of Cy2, 4, 8, every 8 Cy up to EOT (approximately 5.5 years); 120 days after EOT (approximately 5.5 years) (Cy=28 days)"
            }
