              "timeFrame": "Baseline and up to ~77 months"
            },
            {
              "measure": "Change from baseline in fatigue score, on the EORTC QLQ-C30",
              "description": "The EORTC QLQ-C30 is a 30-item questionnaire to assess the overall quality of life of cancer patients. Participant responses to questions about their fatigue are scored on a 4-point scale (1=Not at All to 4=Very Much). Using linear transformation, raw scores are standardized, so that scores range from 0 to 100. A lower score indicates a better level of function.",
