              "description": "Participants will receive coformulation of favezelimab/pembrolizumab administered intravenously plus chemotherapy (investigator's choice of irinotecan or paclitaxel) at specified doses on specified days for a total treatment duration of up to approximately 2 years.",
              "interventionNames": [
                "Biological: Coformulation favezelimab/pembrolizumab",
