              "citation": "Gutierrez M, Lam WS, Hellmann MD, Gubens MA, Aggarwal C, Tan DSW, Felip E, Chiu JWY, Lee JS, Yang JC, Garon EB, Finocchiaro G, Ahn MJ, Luft A, Landers GA, Basso A, Ma H, Kobie J, Palcza J, Cristescu R, Fong L, Snyder A, Yuan J, Herbst RS. Biomarker-directed, pembrolizumab-based combination therapy in non-small cell lung cancer: phase 2 KEYNOTE-495/KeyImPaCT trial interim results. Nat Med. 2023 Jul;29(7):1718-1727. doi: 10.1038/s41591-023-02385-6. Epub 2023 Jul 10."
