              "description": "Participants were screened for the status of 2 clinically validated, independent next generation biomarkers: T cell-inflamed gene expression profile (GEP) and tumor mutational burden (TMB). GEP status was derived from the signature genes present on the NanoString Pan Cancer Immune Panel. TMB status was derived from a 507-gene panel developed by PGDx, Inc. (Baltimore, MD, United States). Participants were then assigned to 1 of 4 biomarker-defined groups (GEP Low/TMB Low, GEP Low/TMB high, GEP high/TMB Low, and GEP High/TMB high).",
