                  "description": "Participants received pembrolizumab 200 mg Q3W intravenously (IV) plus lenvatinib 20 mg orally once daily until disease progression, or until the participant has received 35 administrations of pembrolizumab (approximately 2 years). Participants completing 35 infusions of pembrolizumab may continue with lenvatinib alone until disease progression or toxicity."
                },
