              "description": "Safety of personalized neoantigen vaccine will be measured by the number of subjects experiencing each type of adverse event. Adverse events will be graded according to the National Cancer Institute Common Terminology Criteria for Adverse Events v4.0.",
              "timeFrame": "3 months after the last vaccination injection"
