          "briefTitle": "Gene-Modified T Cells, Vaccine Therapy, and Ipilimumab in Treating Patients With Locally Advanced or Metastatic Malignancies",
          "officialTitle": "NY-ESO-1 TCR Engineered Adoptive Cell Transfer Therapy With CTLA4 Blockade"
