          "briefTitle": "Vaccine Therapy and Biological Therapy in Treating Patients With Advanced Cancer",
          "officialTitle": "VACCINE THERAPY WITH TUMOR SPECIFIC MUTATED P53 OR RAS PEPTIDES ALONE OR IN COMBINATION WITH CELLULAR IMMUNOTHERAPY WITH PEPTIDE ACTIVATED LYMPHOCYTES (PAL CELLS) ALONG WITH SUBCUTANEOUS IL-2"
        },
        "statusModule": {
          "statusVerifiedDate": "2007-04",
          "overallStatus": "COMPLETED",
