          "briefTitle": "GUCY2C Prime-Boost Vaccination for Advanced Colorectal and Small Bowel Adenocarcinomas",
          "officialTitle": "A Phase I, Single-Center, Dose Escalation Trial of Heterologous Prime-Boost Vaccination With Ad5.F35-hGUCY2C-PADRE and Lm-GUCY2C Vaccines in Adults With Advanced Colorectal and Small Bowel Adenocarcinomas"
        },
