            "description": "Participants alive at the time of national reimbursement or site closure were no longer followed for survival and therefore prematurely censored for the OS, PFS, and TTD analysis, leading to less mature data. As the timing of reimbursement and study closure differed between countries, duration of follow-up between sites and countries differed."
