          "briefTitle": "Safety and Efficacy of Carboplatin/Paclitaxel and Carboplatin/Paclitaxel/Bevacizumab With and Without Pictilisib in Previously Untreated Advanced or Recurrent Non-small Cell Lung Cancer",
          "officialTitle": "A Phase II, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled, Randomized Study Evaluating the Safety and Efficacy of Carboplatin/Paclitaxel and Carboplatin/Paclitaxel/Bevacizumab With and Without GDC-0941 in Patients With Previously Untreated Advanced or Recurrent Non-small Cell Lung Cancer"
        },
