          "briefTitle": "A Study to Investigate Atezolizumab Subcutaneous in Patients With Previously Treated Locally Advanced or Metastatic Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer",
          "officialTitle": "A Randomized, Multicenter, Phase Ib/III Study to Investigate the Pharmacokinetics, Efficacy, and Safety of Atezolizumab Subcutaneous Compared With Atezolizumab Intravenous in Patients With Previously Treated Locally Advanced or Metastatic Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer"
        },
        "statusModule": {
