          "briefTitle": "A Phase III Study of Ceralasertib Plus Durvalumab Versus Docetaxel in Patients With Non Small Cell Lung Cancer (NSCLC) Whose Disease Progressed On or After Prior Anti PD (L)1 Therapy And Platinum Based Chemotherapy",
          "officialTitle": "A Phase III, Open-label, Randomised, Multicentre Study of Ceralasertib Plus Durvalumab Versus Docetaxel in Patients With Advanced or Metastatic Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer Without Actionable Genomic Alterations, and Whose Disease Has Progressed On or After Prior Anti-PD-(L)1 Therapy and Platinum-based Chemotherapy: LATIFY",
          "acronym": "LATIFY"
        },
