- **Name:** Sofia Reyes  
- **Observation in the graph:** “Trilingual in Spanish and Mandarin”

**Greeting (“hello there my friend”) in each language**

| Language | Greeting |
|----------|----------|
| Spanish  | **¡Hola, amigo/a!** (literally “Hello, my friend!”) |
| Mandarin | **你好，我的朋友！** (Nǐ hǎo, wǒ de péngyǒu!) |

**Mexican singer with the same full name**

The only well‑known Mexican singer named **Sofía Reyes** (the spelling differs by an accent but is the same personal name) was born in:

- **City of birth:** **Monterrey, Mexico**

So you can greet Sofia Reyes as “¡Hola, amigo/a! 你好，我的朋友!” and note that the Mexican singer Sofía Reyes hails from Monterrey."}]

