          "briefTitle": "Ketogenic Diet vs.Antiepileptic Drug Treatment in Drug Resistant Epilepsy",
          "officialTitle": "Comparing Ketogenic Diet With the Most Appropriate Antiepileptic Drug- a Randomized Study of Children With Mental Retardation and Drug Resistant Epilepsy"
        },
        "statusModule": {
