          "briefTitle": "Clinical Trial of Felbamate for Treatment-Resistant Bipolar Depression",
          "officialTitle": "A Double-Blind Randomized Placebo-Controlled Trial of Felbamate in Treatment Resistant Bipolar Depression"
        },
        "statusModule": {
