}"}], "tool_call_id": "call_xjdfyjc2"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "**Summary of Safety Findings (Non‑Systematic Assessment)**  

| **Organ System** | **Key Adverse Events (AEs) with Highest Event Counts** | **Total Events (EG000 + EG001)** |
|------------------|--------------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------|
| **Cardiac disorders** | • Acute left ventricular failure – 8 events  <br>• Ventricular tachycardia – 11 events  <br>• Pneumonia (often cardiac‑related) – 56 events* | ≈ 150 |
| **General disorders** | • Death – 11 events  <br>• Chest pain – 22 events  <br>• Dizziness – 235 events  <br>• Oedema / peripheral swelling – 5–6 events each | ≈ 300 |
| **Infections & infestations** | • Pneumonia – 56 events (see above)  <br>• COVID‑19 – 197 events  <br>• Urinary tract infection – 21 events  <br>• Cellulitis – 13 events | ≈ 300 |
