| **Vascular disorders** | • Hypertension – 10 events  <br>• Deep‑vein thrombosis / pulmonary embolism – 6–9 events each | ≈ 30 |
| **Gastrointestinal disorders** | • Diarrhoea – 197 events (most frequent GI AE)  <br>• Nausea, vomiting, abdominal pain – ≤ 10 events each | ≈ 210 |
| **Nervous system disorders** | • Dizziness – 235 events (also listed under General)  <br>• Syncope – 25 events  <br>• Headache – 1 event | ≈ 260 |
